# Project Tech Stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| Package manager | pnpm |
| Framework | Next.js (App Router) |
| Language | TypeScript |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| UI library | shadcn/ui (`@/components/ui`) |
| Client state | Zustand |
| ORM | Prisma |
| Database | MongoDB |
| Auth | Clerk (Google OAuth only) |
| Hosting | Vercel |

## Conventions

- Install/run with `pnpm` only (`pnpm add`, `pnpm dev`, `pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add …`).
- Prefer shadcn primitives; do not hand-roll Button/Dialog/Input duplicates.
- Map UI colors to brand-kit / CSS tokens — no hardcoded hex when a token exists.
- Client state: Zustand stores under `src/store/` — do not introduce a second global state library.
- Auth: Google via Clerk only — no email/password flows.
- App source lives under `src/` (`@/` → `./src/*`).
- Brand reference: `guidance/brand-kit.md`, CSS tokens in `starter/tokens.css`, app theme in `src/app/globals.css`.
